Package: apiplant
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Federico Rampazzo <federico@apiplant.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/apiplant/apiplant
Section: web
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: Point it at an app directory and it serves an API
 apiplant reads an app directory - resource definitions, functions, an optional
 main.toml - and serves it as an HTTP API, with an admin dashboard, a terminal
 console and a visual editor built into the same binary.
 .
 The package declares no dependencies: the binary links only libc, libm and
 libgcc_s, which are part of every Debian installation. It is built against
 glibc 2.35, so it needs Debian 12 (bookworm) or newer, or Ubuntu 22.04 or
 newer.
